  "question": {
    "text": "If the mean of the data: $7,8,9,7,8,7, \\lambda, 8$ is 8 , then the variance of this data is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Htpkq",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{9}{8}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MHmgY",
      "text": "\n2\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "glYET",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{7}{8}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "lR1a6",
      "text": "\n1",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { } \\begin{aligned}\n&\\bar{x}=\\frac{7+8+9+7+8+7+\\lambda+8}{8}=8 \\\\\n&\\Rightarrow \\frac{54+\\lambda}{8}=8 \\Rightarrow \\lambda=10\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nNow variance $=\\sigma^2$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(7-8)^2+(8-8)^2+(9-8)^2+(7-8)^2+(8-8)^2 \\\\\n&=\\frac{+(7-8)^2+(10-8)^2+(8-8)^2}{8} \\\\\n&\\Rightarrow \\sigma^2=\\frac{1+0+1+1+0+1+4+0}{8}=\\frac{8}{8}=1 \\\\\n&\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nHence, the variance is 1 .",
    "image": null
  },
